'''Perfectly Balanced''' is an [[Combat Achievements/Elite|elite combat achievement]] which requires the player to kill the [[Vanguards]] without them resetting their health.

'''For solo-run attempts, be sure raid scaling is set to "0" for the easiest fight, as scaling a raid to "1" doubles boss health.'''

